{{Splblocknotes
| name = Summon Raptors
| desc = {{A|Raptor|Dive Bomb}} does not interact with [[Spell Block]] sources.
}}
{{Splreflectnotes
| name = Summon Raptors
| desc = {{A|Raptor|Dive Bomb}} does not interact with [[Spell Reflection]] sources.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Summon Raptors icon0}}
| desc = Beastmaster summons 2 hawks that circle around Beastmaster and dive-bombs at enemies with a base attack rate of every 4s, damaging and rooting them. Attack rate increases with the Hawk's attack speed. Prioritizes heroes.
}}
* The Raptor orbits around Beastmaster correspondingly to its {{M|movement speed}}.
** While Beastmaster is moving, the summoned Raptor may spiral and accelerate to keep their position symetrically apart, with each Raptor making {{#expr:{{#var:Summon Raptors value4}}/{{#var:Summon Raptors value5}}}} revolutions over the summon's total duration.
** Grants the Raptor the following {{M|movement speed}} bonus correspondingly to its distance to Beastmaster:
*** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|[[Movement Speed|MS]] {{=}} {{G|max move speed}} , if {{#var:Summon Raptors value3}} < Distance ⪅ 1500}}
*** Directly moves the Raptor to Beastmaster's current coordinates if {{Code|Distance ⪅ 1501}}
**** Does not {{M|disjoint}} {{M|projectiles}} when moved this way.

