fields.value:
{{Splblocknotes
| name = Primal Roar
| desc = {{Symbol|bonus agh}} Grants {{A|Beastmaster|Drums of Slom}} stacks upon cast regardless.
}}

 * [[File:Dota2 Beastmaster Primal Roar Visualized icon.png|105px]] The ability has two main components:
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Beastmaster Primal Roar Visualized icon-1a.png|105px]][[File:Dota2 Beastmaster Primal Roar Visualized icon-2a.png|105px]]
*** {{Code|OP {{=}} {{#var:Primal Roar cast range}}}}
*** The ability effects are applied as follows upon cast on {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] :
***# The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
***# {{Symbol|Stun}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|[[stun]]ned}}
***# {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
***#* Grants {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|beastmaster_primal_roar_speed}} to all Beastmaster and his {{M|player-controlled units}} within the radius.
***#** Affects all {{M|uncontrollable}} units.
***#* {{cf|aghnotes}} Set {{A|Beastmaster|Drums of Slom}} stacks to {{ValueColor||{{Show|A|Beastmaster|Drums of Slom|type2 value1}}|agh}}.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Beastmaster Primal Roar Visualized icon-1.png|105px]][[File:Dota2 Beastmaster Primal Roar Visualized icon-2.png|105px]]
*** {{Symbol|bonus aoe}}
**** The ability has a [[Wikipedia:Stadium (geometry)|stadium-shaped]] [[area-of-effect]], the greater the distance between Beastmaster [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|O|21px]] {{Symbol|Facing Angle|r}} and the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] , the greater the the width of [[File:Dota2 Letter-s.png|S|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-b.png|B|21px]] . This is defined as:
***** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|SQ {{=}} QB {{=}} ([[Wikipedia:Absolute value|{{!}}]] BeastmasterPosition - EnemyPosition [[Wikipedia:Absolute value|{{!}}]]) / 2}}
***** Can affect enemy units up to a max {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{#expr:{{#var:Primal Roar cast range}}*1.5}}-distance away with the default [[cast range]].
*** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
**** Enemy units within the following [[area-of-effect]] are considered valid secondary units:
***** [[File:Dota2 Beastmaster Primal Roar Visualized icon-4a.png|84px]][[File:Dota2 Beastmaster Primal Roar Visualized icon-4b.png|84px]]
****** Within both Area [[File:Dota2 Letter-s.png|S|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-q.png|Q|21px]] and [[File:Dota2 Letter-q.png|Q|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-b.png|B|21px]] .
***** [[File:Dota2 Beastmaster Primal Roar Visualized icon-3a.png|84px]][[File:Dota2 Beastmaster Primal Roar Visualized icon-3b.png|84px]]
****** Within both Circle [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|21px|O]] and [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] , this includes both radii behind Beastmaster and the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy respectively.
*** The ability effects are applied to all secondary units:
***# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|beastmaster_primal_roar_push}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Forced Movement}}
***#* {{M|Stun}}
***#* Applies an offensive [[knockback]] at a fixed distance, with {{#expr:{{#var:Primal Roar type1 value2}}/{{#var:Primal Roar type1 value5}}}}-speed.
***#** {{M|Status resistance}} sources neither affects the knockback distance nor the knockback duration. Hence, it affects the knockback speed.
***#** When a secondary enemy unit is perfectly aligned with Beastmaster [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|O|21px]] {{Symbol|Facing Angle|r}} and the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] , the knockback component is not applied.
***#*** However, all ability effects affecting secondary units still applies.
***#* Reapplying the debuff refreshes its duration.
***#* {{Symbol|Trees}}
***#** [[Trees]] within {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} 100-radius that all affected secondary enemy units come in contact with are destroyed.
***# {{Symbol|Turn Rate}}
***#* Forcefully [[turns]] affected secondary enemy units {{M|facing angle|text=facing}} toward the knocked direction.
***# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|beastmaster_primal_roar_slow}}
***#* Reapplying the debuff refreshes its duration.
***# The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.

* All ability components affects the following units:
** {{M|Couriers}}
** {{M|Fogged units|text=Fogged}} secondary units.
** {{M|Invisible}} secondary units.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Primal Roar icon0}}
| desc = Beastmaster lets loose a deafening roar that stuns, and shoves open a path to its target. All units in the path of the roar are damaged, while units shoved aside by the roar have their movement and attack speed slowed. Additionally, Beastmaster and his units gain 40% movement speed for 2 seconds.
}}
* {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|beastmaster_primal_roar_slow}}
** Has an effective max total {{calc|v1-{{#var:Primal Roar type1 value6}}|v1={{#var:Primal Roar type1 value7}}}}-second debuff duration as it is applied at the same time with the {{M|knockback}} component.

